  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Horn of Africa Child Wasting Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Part of a &#x20AC;50m 3-year pledge to combat child wasting globally, the Horn of Africa-Child Wasting Initiative addresses child wasting in Ethiopia, Kenya and Somalia in regional and cross border context, by tackling the drivers and implications of child wasting through a multisectoral, community-led programming approach; supporting innovation in programming and partnerships; and generating more effective local, national, and global child wasting prevention strategies.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme to address child wasting in the Horn, in particular in Ethiopia, Kenya and Somalia</narrative>
